
# debug screenshots dumped by generate-screenshots on failure
static/img/debug_*.png

# pagefind search index; generated by `pnpm index` for local dev search, and by
# `pnpm build` straight into dist/ for production. Never commit it.
static/pagefind/

# gallery card thumbnails, derived from the committed figures by
# `pnpm gen:gallery-thumbs` (which `dev` and `build` run for you). Not committed:
# they are ~3.4MB regenerated from files already in the repo, and the figures
# they derive from churn hard enough (517 revisions in three months) that
# tracking them would add ~160MB/yr of undeltifiable binary history.
static/img/gallery-thumbs/
